{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3044d42e-26d0-8dfe-9fb7-cf0e9fb89573",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:22:20-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:32-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. I want to report a dip in the road. It was a utility trench, and it settled. Now there's a low spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:41-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a settled trench. Where is this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:45-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "461 Harrison Avenue. On the Fort Adams side. The dip is right in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:52-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "461 Harrison. Got it. When did you notice it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:19:56-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was there a little before. After the rain that ended Saturday, it got worse. The patch sank more. It holds water now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:05-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. The fill settles and then the rain finds it. How deep would you say, a couple inches?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:13-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About three inches. Maybe four in the middle. It's about as wide as a car lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:20-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so three, four inches deep, full lane width, filled with water after the rain. Writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:27-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I hit it Sunday. Didn't see it because of the puddle. The car bottomed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:34-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, sorry to hear that. Any damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:37-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not sure yet. It's making a noise. I'm getting it looked at. Does the city reimburse for car damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:20:45-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a claims process for that. I can't tell you how it'll go, but you'd file a claim with the city, and they review it. Keep your repair estimate and any receipts. Take a photo of the dip too, if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:01-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. Who do I send it to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:06-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it on this report, and I can transfer you to the city clerk's office after this. They handle the claim forms."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:15-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long do repairs usually take? For something like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:20-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the crew schedule. After a wet week we get a lot of these. Could be a few days, could be a couple weeks. A utility trench sometimes involves the utility company too, so that can add time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:35-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So no firm date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:38-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No firm date from me, no. But it's logged, and I'll mark it as a hazard since a car already hit it. What's a good number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:49-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:50-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "0169. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:52-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Manuel Moniz. M-O-N-I-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:54-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Manuel. You been on Harrison long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:21:57-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple years. I came to Rhode Island for a job and stayed. I rent the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:22:04-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, welcome to the potholes. It's a Newport tradition. Alright, you're all set on my end. Want me to send you over to the clerk's office now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:22:14-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:22:16-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Hold on one second, transferring you now."
    }
  ],
